# local task checklist
TODO.md

# HyperFrames build output — snapshots are throwaway QA frames, and the
# rendered MP4s are uploaded to Cloudinary rather than committed. The
# compositions themselves are kept so the videos stay re-renderable.
videos/*/renders/
videos/*/snapshots/

# Site footage is only staged under public/videos on its way to Cloudinary,
# which serves it (scripts/upload-videos.mjs). Keeping these hundreds of
# megabytes out of the repo and the image is the whole point. Caption tracks
# are a few KB of text and stay committed, so this matches media by extension
# rather than ignoring the tree.
public/videos/**/*.mp4
public/videos/**/*.mov
public/videos/**/*.webm

